=== 2026-10-04T15:31:33Z stage fit
# Split-rule sweep: rule fitting

Generated by `sweep.py fit`. Each rule's time on a shape is the measured time of its pick; gaps are against the best measured configuration of the shape. "within 1.5%" counts shapes no more than 1.5% behind it. Leave-one-S-out and leave-one-k-out fit the rule without one grid value and score it on the shapes that have that value, so every shape is predicted by a rule that never saw its S (or its k).

| rule | in-sample: within 1.5% | worst | geomean | leave-one-S-out: within 1.5% | worst | geomean | leave-one-k-out: within 1.5% | worst | geomean |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| capped (measured) | 385 of 576 | -26.4% | -2.42% | 385 of 576 | -26.4% | -2.42% | 385 of 576 | -26.4% | -2.42% |
| auto (measured) | 215 of 576 | -41.1% | -8.76% | 215 of 576 | -41.1% | -8.76% | 215 of 576 | -41.1% | -8.76% |
| capped's formula on the grid's n | 388 of 576 | -26.2% | -2.27% | 388 of 576 | -26.2% | -2.27% | 388 of 576 | -26.2% | -2.27% |
| formula | 434 of 576 | -14.9% | -1.38% | 419 of 576 | -14.9% | -1.58% | 408 of 576 | -14.9% | -1.67% |
| table | 573 of 576 | -5.4% | -0.11% | 494 of 576 | -11.1% | -0.74% | 459 of 576 | -26.2% | -1.57% |
| table, smoothed | 538 of 576 | -12.0% | -0.39% | 476 of 576 | -16.3% | -1.01% | 451 of 576 | -26.2% | -1.76% |

**Chosen: table** (mean cross-validated geomean -1.16%; formula -1.63%, table -1.16%, table, smoothed -1.38%).

Formula constants fitted on the whole grid (capped's in brackets):

| constant | meaning | fitted | capped |
|---|---|---:|---:|
| T | split when (256 - S) * k >= T * 256 | 16 | 20 |
| F | reduce-scatter when 256 // S >= F | 12 | 8 |
| P | reduce-scatter n <= P // S | 160 | 128 |
| ck | reduce-scatter n >= k // ck | 6 | 8 |
| nmin | reduce-scatter n >= nmin | 8 | 8 |
| c0 | owner n = round(sqrt(k / max(c0, S / d))) | 1.0 | 2.2 |
| d | (owner) | 8 | 5 |
| tt | two-tile from (W waves, d <= D) | None | None |

Chosen rule (in-sample) against capped, by wave class:

| wave class | shapes | rule: within 1.5% | geomean | capped: within 1.5% | geomean |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| no full wave | 192 | 190 | -0.16% | 74 | -5.41% |
| 1-3 full waves | 192 | 191 | -0.10% | 138 | -1.20% |
| 4-7 full waves | 192 | 192 | -0.07% | 173 | -0.59% |

